  <!-- EN: Empire Threat Level governs how dangerous each attack is. Attack Frequency governs how often they come.\n\nAttack frequency is driven by your settlement count: roughly 1.0x at one settlement, 1.4x at five, 1.8x at ten, and 2.0x at fifteen or more. It is capped only by the "min/max days till military action" setting; attacks will never occur more frequently than the minimum value.\n\nIn practical terms, a sprawling fifteen-settlement empire faces attacks roughly twice as often as a single-settlement empire, even if both have identical Empire Threat Level.\n<i><color=#66E0E4FF>Empire Refactored</color></i> -->
