  <!-- EN: Prosperity -->
  <Codex_Prosperity.label>TODO</Codex_Prosperity.label>
  <!-- EN: Prosperity is a 0–100 stat on each settlement that directly multiplies all resource production.\n\nAt 50 prosperity, your settlement produces half as much as at 100. At 1, production is nearly zero.\n\nProsperity drifts daily toward a target calculated from your other social stats:\n  Target = (Happiness + Loyalty + (100 − Unrest)) / 3\n\nThe drift rate is 1 point per day (plus any stat modifiers from policies, buildings, or events). If your happiness and loyalty are high and unrest is low, prosperity will climb. If social stats deteriorate, prosperity follows.\n\nLosing a defensive battle costs 20 prosperity immediately, which can take many days to recover from.\n<i><color=#66E0E4FF>Empire Refactored</color></i> -->
